  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is magnetic field,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>&nbsp;is velocity of rod and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;is the length of rod, then induced EMF in moving road is given by&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />As given circuit forms balanced whetstone bridge, the current through <math><mn>3</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> is zero.<br />Equivalent resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1.7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br />Current&nbsp;in the circuit <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>167</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>170</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;A</mi></math></p>",
